      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make an Apple-Tansey.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nPare your Apples and cut them in thin round slices, then fry them in good sweet Butter, then take ten Eggs, sweet Cream, Nutmeg, Cinamon, Ginger, Sugar, with a little Rose-water, beat all these together, and poure it upon your Apples and fry it.\u003Cbr\u003E"
